        #region Extract Blobset Version 3
        /// 
        /// Read Blobset header and than extract's file's to a folder - version 3.
        /// 
        /// File path to file blobset file
        /// The extract Background Worker
        /// 
        /// [Wouldubeinta]		05/07/2025	Created
