        #region Modify Blobset Version 3
        /// 
        /// Read Filemapping and than create file's for the blobset - version 3.
        /// 
        /// File path to blobset file
        /// The modify Background Worker
        /// 
        /// [Wouldubeinta]		05/07/2025	Created
